  s2v_l1b_kummer_deck_aux S Y Z W₀ B₀ hdimY hdimZ a e ha1 hamul hinj p₀ hp₀ hpsurj hporbit C eY hpointAction r σ y rot hrot hy hbranch hexp hpair h hh q₀ hqsurj hqinv hq γ hγsurj hγinv hγ β₀ hβ₀ d₀ hd₀ hgenerator B e₀ b D hD₀ htransform hcartier hblowup η hη₀ hη eW heW hgeneric w hw d hd hdinit hdw horder i x hx₁ hx₂ havoid

